# Formspree form ID for the Contact section's form.
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io and create a new form.
# 2. Copy the ID from your form's endpoint: https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX
# 3. Put that ID (just the XXXXXXXX part) below.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) for local dev, and add the same
# key/value in your Vercel project's Environment Variables for production.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
